# Next.js Protected Screenshot Rules

- Always inject authentication cookies before calling `page.goto()`.
- Use high DPI scaling (`device_scale_factor=2`) for legible multimodal inspection.
- Wait for client component hydration to prevent capturing skeleton loaders.
